r processing unit\" OR \"power processing units\" OR \"power control and distribution\" OR \"power management and distribution\" OR \"electrical architecture\" OR \"electrical architectures\" OR \"power architecture\" OR \"power architectures\" OR \"DC power bus\" OR \"DC power buses\" OR \"PCDU\" OR \"PCDUs\" OR \"PMAD\" OR \"PMADs\")",
